# Keeps the build context to what is actually built from.
#
# Without this the context is 4.9 GB, of which 4.8 GB is never copied by any stage:
# BACKUPS (3.3 GB) and rust/target (1.5 GB, the host's build output — the builder stage
# compiles into its own target directory inside the container).
#
# Nothing listed here is referenced by a COPY in oci/Dockerfile. That is the rule for adding
# a line: if a stage copies it, it does not belong here.
.git
BACKUPS
EVIDENCE
rust/target
**/node_modules
